            <ArticleTitle>Subcapsular hepatic hematoma in an otherwise uncomplicated pregnancy.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>44-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Subcapsular hepatic hematoma is rare in pregnancies not complicated by pre-eclampsia or the HELLP syndrome. We now report such a case.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
